ver exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Start free and upgrade when your team needs more power. Every plan includes SSL, daily backups and 99.9% uptime.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Current plan</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">For individuals exploring the basics.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">$0</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">per month, forever</span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Up to 3 projects</li>\n        <li>1 GB of storage</li>\n        <li>Community support</li>\n        <li>Basic analytics (7-day history)</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">Custom domains</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">Team collaboration</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Get started free</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Pro</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">For freelancers and growing products.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">$12</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">per user, per month, billed monthly. $10 billed yearly.</span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n        <li>50 GB of storage</li>\n        <li>Priority email support (24h response)</li>\n        <li>Advanced analytics (1-year history)</li>\n        <li>Custom domains</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">Team collaboration</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-block\">Upgrade to Pro</button>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best for scale</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">For organisations that need control and collaboration.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">$29</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">per user, per month, billed monthly. $24 billed yearly.</span>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Everything in Pro</li>\n        <li>500 GB of storage</li>\n        <li>Role-based access controls</li>\n        <li>Shared team workspaces</li>\n        <li>Single sign-on (SAML)</li>\n        <li>Dedicated support manager</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Contact sales</button>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Minimum of 5 seats. Volume discounts available.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <h3>Compare plans at a glance</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th><th>Team</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Projects</td><td>3</td><td>Unl